@startuml
title Planned: JSE - Pickup collection and HUD notification
participant ArenaScene as Scene
participant CollisionSystem as Collision
participant ArenaRules as Rules
participant World
participant EventBus as Bus
participant HudObserver as Hud
participant EventLogObserver as Log
Scene -> Collision : findOverlaps(world.view())
Collision --> Scene : player-pickup pair
Scene -> Rules : applyCollisions(world, pairs, dt, tick)
Rules -> Rules : confirm pickup not pending removal
Rules -> Rules : increase score once
Rules -> World : enqueueRemove(pickupId, COLLECTED)
World -> World : mark pending removal immediately
Rules -> Bus : publish(ItemCollected(newScore))
Scene -> World : commitChanges(tick)
World -> World : remove pickup
World -> Bus : publish(EntityRemoved)
Scene -> Rules : evaluateOutcome(world, tick)\n(death before victory)
opt first terminal transition
  Rules -> Bus : publish(GameFinished)
end
Scene -> Bus : dispatchPending()
Bus -> Hud : onEvent(ItemCollected)
Hud -> Hud : update displayed score
Bus -> Log : onEvent(ItemCollected)
Bus -> Log : onEvent(EntityRemoved)
opt game finished
  Bus -> Hud : onEvent(GameFinished)
  Bus -> Log : onEvent(GameFinished)
end
note over Scene
Core requests repaint after updates.
end note
note over Rules,Hud
ArenaRules owns the true score.
HudObserver displays event data.
Rules do not call the HUD directly.
end note
@enduml
